@SportMatch_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Get all games
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/getall
Accept: application/json

### Get game by id
GET {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/get?id=1
Accept: application/json

### Create a game
POST {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "footballFieldId": 999,
  "createdByUsername": "lukas",
  "startTime": "2026-10-09T18:00:00Z",
  "maxPlayers": 10
}

### Delete a game
DELETE {{SportMatch_HostAddress}}/games/delete?id=1